
## [5482e5d] A review lane, and a coordinator shared with the realtime path
OK   A1 every review enqueue uses the BACKGROUND lane :: {"lanes":["BACKGROUND","BACKGROUND"],"trigger":"STREAM_END"}
NOTE A2 first runBatch() items :: [{"status":"FAILED","taskId":"id-1","eventId":null,"errorCode":"REVIEW_TASK_UNKNOWN"}]
