## [5482e5d] B task-local author aliases
OK   B1 model input carries no sender reference, channel id or platform message id :: {"items":[{"itemId":"i0","text":"[a-n-1-1] hello one"},{"itemId":"i1","text":"[a-n-1-1] hello two"},{"itemId":"i2","text":"[a-n-1-2] hello three"}]}
OK   B2 within one task the same author has one alias, another author a different one :: ["a-n-1-1","a-n-1-1","a-n-1-2"]
OK   B3 model items have only itemId and text
OK   B4 the same author gets a different alias in the next task :: {"first":"a-n-1-1","next":"a-n-2-1"}

## [5482e5d] C unified settlement, real scoring engine and SQLite ledger port
OK   C1 settled once, one ledger row and score +2; a later applyVerdict for the same event writes nothing (the port returns the first change) :: {"batch":[{"status":"SETTLED","taskId":"id-1","eventId":"ev-d1","classification":"ALLOW_MEANINGFUL","scoring":"APPLIED"}],"rows":[{"k":"event:ch-1:d1","d":2}],"again":{"contractVersion":"1","subjectRef":"d9023c9e-7919-477f-9a9b-9fa79c2584cc","delta":2,"idempotencyKey":"event:ch-1:d1"},"score":{"current":2,"behavior":2,"identity":0,"version":1,"lastRewardAt":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z"},"resumed":0}
OK   C2 two writers: one SETTLED, the other NOT_ELIGIBLE, one ledger row :: {"o1":[{"status":"SETTLED","taskId":"id-1","eventId":"ev-d2","classification":"ALLOW_MEANINGFUL","scoring":"APPLIED"}],"o2":[{"status":"NOT_ELIGIBLE","taskId":"id-1","eventId":"ev-d2","reason":"NOT_UNSETTLED"}],"rowsE":[{"k":"event:ch-1:d2","d":2}]}
OK   C3 manual decision and deletion in between: NOT_ELIGIBLE, no ledger row :: {"items":[{"status":"NOT_ELIGIBLE","taskId":"id-1","eventId":"ev-d3","reason":"MANUALLY_DECIDED"},{"status":"NOT_ELIGIBLE","taskId":"id-2","eventId":"ev-d4","reason":"DELETION_IN_PROGRESS"}],"rows3":[]}
OK   C4 expired evidence: UNSETTLED_EXPIRED, model not called, no score :: {"cycle":{"trigger":"STREAM_END","enqueued":0,"expired":1,"skipped":[]},"state":"UNSETTLED_EXPIRED"}
OK   C5 exception subject: scoring REFUSED by the port, no ledger row, outcome recorded :: {"item":{"status":"SETTLED","taskId":"id-1","eventId":"ev-d6","classification":"ALLOW_MEANINGFUL","scoring":"REFUSED"},"outcomes":[{"k":"event:ch-1:d6","o":"REFUSED","r":"EXCEPTION_ACTIVE"}],"retry":{"contractVersion":"1","subjectRef":"excepted-ch-1-viewer-x","delta":0,"idempotencyKey":"event:ch-1:d6"}}

