## [5482e5d] E task-coordinator settled-record window (Q38)
OK   E1 records held stay within the window plus open tasks (10 + 3) :: {"retained":13}
OK   E2 open tasks are never evicted :: ["QUEUED","QUEUED","QUEUED"]
OK   E3 a late result for an evicted record is discarded, a late failure is ignored :: {"late":{"status":"discarded","reason":"UNKNOWN_TASK"},"lateFail":{"status":"ignored","reason":"UNKNOWN_TASK"}}
NOTE E4 statusOf for an evicted record :: TaskNotFoundError

## [5482e5d] F candidate cards and confirmation
OK   F1 a review proposal becomes a PENDING_CONFIRMATION card with its source, and publishes nothing :: {"cards":[{"id":"card-1","channelId":"ch-1","term":"synth-term","note":"synthetic","sourceCorrelationId":"corr-ch-1-f1","sourceTaskId":"id-1","status":"PENDING_CONFIRMATION","createdAt":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","decidedByRef":null,"decidedAt":null,"ruleVersion":null}],"published":[]}
OK   F2 DATA_ADMIN (real role matrix) cannot confirm: 403, nothing published :: {"status":403,"body":{"error":"FORBIDDEN"}}
OK   F3 a moderator of another channel gets 404, nothing published :: {"status":404,"body":{"error":"CANDIDATE_NOT_FOUND"}}
OK   F4 a moderator confirms: 200, one publish, card keeps source and gets the rule version :: {"status":200,"body":{"status":"CONFIRMED","card":{"id":"card-1","term":"synth-term","note":"synthetic","sourceCorrelationId":"corr-ch-1-f1","status":"CONFIRMED","createdAt":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","decidedAt":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","ruleVersion":2}}}
OK   F5 a second confirmation is 409 and publishes nothing :: {"status":409,"body":{"error":"ALREADY_DECIDED","card":{"id":"card-1","term":"synth-term","note":"synthetic","sourceCorrelationId":"corr-ch-1-f1","status":"CONFIRMED","createdAt":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","decidedAt":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","ruleVersion":2}}}
NOTE F6 card states available :: ["PENDING_CONFIRMATION","CONFIRMED"]
NOTE F7 routes exposed :: ["listCards","confirm"]

